<threat_model>
## Trust Boundaries

| Boundary | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| browser client to API | task create/list/patch carry user-controlled fields; must be validated and tenant-scoped |
| API to MongoDB | every read/write must apply _tenant_filter; cross-tenant access is the primary risk |
| API to agent (instruction queue + Socket.IO) | dispatch must target only the task's own agent |
| backend to browser (Socket.IO) | broadcast_remediation_update must emit only to the task's tenant |

## STRIDE Threat Register

| Threat ID | Category | Component | Disposition | Mitigation Plan |
|-----------|----------|-----------|-------------|-----------------|
| T-04-03 | Information Disclosure | GET/PATCH /tasks | mitigate | `_tenant_filter(current_user)` applied to every query; super-admins get `{}`, all others scoped to tenantId (04-PATTERNS.md Pattern 1) |
| T-04-04 | Tampering | TaskCreate body | mitigate | Pydantic `Field(min_length, max_length)` on title/description; priority/status constrained at service layer (V5) |
| T-04-05 | Elevation of Privilege | dispatch_rescan agent target | mitigate | agent_id resolved server-side from the task's own asset_id; client cannot inject an arbitrary agent into the instruction |
| T-04-06 | Denial of Service | GET /tasks list | mitigate | `to_list(length=500)` cap on the list query (Security Domain) |
| T-04-07 | Information Disclosure | suggest_remediation LLM call | mitigate | generate_text(source='remediation_suggestion') runs guardrail_service input+output scans (AI-SPEC.md) |
| T-04-SC | Tampering | npm/pip/cargo installs | accept | No package installs in this phase (04-RESEARCH.md Package Legitimacy Audit: N/A); all libs pre-existing |
</threat_model>

